  "title": "Protection",
  "storyCode": "0-2",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1e770f562170c37329102e1f3c318addf12fc7f41e22bc7c6764679fa4a508e4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Ugh... Gahh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Those Reunion goons... sure are energetic!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursus Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Who are you people?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursus Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Why are you in Chernobog at a time like this?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Huh? Wh-what's going on--"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursus Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Are you spies?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "(If our identities get revealed and the Ursus government starts to keep an eye on us, the consequences would be unfathomable!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "(If it comes down to it...!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Sir."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursus Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "... A little girl?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursus Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "You're... an Infected?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursus Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Stop right there! Put down your weapon!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "(Be ready to back her up. If they show any signs of hostility...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "(Smoke? Where did it come from...?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Sir, surely you understand that we have a common enemy!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Dobermann!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Defenders! They're attacking!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursus Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Wh-what?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Reunion... they're here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Amiya, be careful..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "She's on a completely different level compared to those ordinary thugs!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "Hmph. Trying to run...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "Where do you think you're going?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "Go. Tear them apart."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Even her minions seem like they're well-trained..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Could she be Reunion's ringleader?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "The haze is getting thicker and thicker... are they planning to utilize it to launch a surprise attack?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Sir, we have to evacuate immediately!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "If they manage to cut off our escape route, we'll all..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursus Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursus Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Get lost, Infected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursus Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I was tasked with defending this street."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursus Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Rabbit, I don't care why you came here or what you plan to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursus Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "If you plan to ruin our city, know that someone will come after you. The rage of Ursus is never-ending."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursus Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "If not, then what happens here is none of your business."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "... I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursus Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Everybody in Ursus knows to never turn their back to the enemy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursus Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Now scram! We don't have time to deal with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Dobermann!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Hurry! Let's get to the first rendezvous point!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "All teams, move out! Quick!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursus Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Come at us, Infected filth!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursus Captain",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Is that all you're capable of? Are you just going to stand there staring at us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "All Chernobogians..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "Must die."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
